{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"　\nこんばちは\n朝牛乳を飲んで一日中出かけて帰ってきたらキッチンに牛乳が、、やってしまったこの暑い夏の日に牛乳を出しっぱなしにして家を出てしまいました。\n嗅いだことのない匂いがしたけど気になって仕方なかったので一口飲んでみました。危険すぎる味がしたのですぐ処分しました。ごめんね牛乳、、🥛"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもなんでホットミルクは美味しいんだろう？不思議がまたひとつ増えた日でした。\n佐々木久美です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この間のミーグリのお写真🐈"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3QD6XFM888NKXCFSCX9F70","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3QD83K4NVMZ0BYDEK190PR","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3QD95BGAPJH3FA94WS04T5","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3QDA70Z7DQV8GPTZ8SAR7A","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">どんどん近づくね〜🥟\nめいが撮ってくれたの！めいとペアレーンでした〜いちごみるくレーン🍓🍼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3QDBB69NRWM5H0DJQFX0V1","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3QDCBH6E22NPEKZYWR4KQX","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nたまたまおそろいだったワンピース着て、髪型もお揃いにしたりしました〜🦦\nたのしかったですありがとうございました🧚‍♀️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3QDDCSJ7FZ224N61X13618","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3QDEF2G55RDMN41BFK6776","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3QDFMFJREQM8ACPYEWQ7A7","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3QDGQCX12Z41GBT8WHMNTJ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3QDHRCBAM1ZA10WGYWKTH0","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3QDJWWGZE83NST5SGJH679","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3QDKWYMGE7ETGZ6Q2DK4DS","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3QDMX46YX8CFN9XJ53D6QJ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nフィルムカメラにハマってます🧠現像までどきどきなのがたまらないのです〜KUMIFILM🎞なんちて〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではまたね( ˙-˙ )/\n佐々木久美"}],"source":"archive"}